# The shop is a static build on handcraftedbyhaze.com; the API and the admin
# are served from this host. Absolute on purpose: the same bundle is published
# to both places, and from the API's own host these calls are same-origin,
# which is what keeps the admin's session cookie first-party.
VITE_API_URL=https://handcraftedbyhaze.gleearl.com
